@startuml
title Flight Search Module : Search Flight Information

actor "Traveller" as Actor
participant UI as ":flightSearch"
participant Ctrl as ":flightController"
participant Flights as ":serpApiGoogleFlightsAPI"

Actor -> UI: Enter origin, destination and travel date
Actor -> UI: Click Search Flights
UI -> Ctrl: Submit flight search criteria
Ctrl -> Ctrl: validateFlightSearchCriteria()

alt [Flight search criteria are invalid]
    Ctrl --> UI: Display flight search validation error
else [Flight search criteria are valid]
    Ctrl -> Flights: retrieveFlightOptions(searchCriteria)
    Flights --> Ctrl: Flight search result

    alt [Flight options are available]
        Ctrl --> UI: Display flight options
    else [No flights are found]
        Ctrl --> UI: Display no flight options message
    else [Flight search service is unavailable]
        Ctrl --> UI: Display flight search service unavailable message
    end
end
@enduml
